// Test: Evidence marker Known (!) basic usage
// Spec: 03-TYPES.md § 2.1 Evidence Markers
// Priority: P0
//
// Purpose:
// Validates that the Known (!) evidence marker can be applied to
// basic types and that values with Known evidence can be constructed
// and used.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should compile and run successfully, printing 42

rite main() {
    ≔ x: !i32 = 42;
    println(x);
}
